{"title":"2008 Indonesia MO Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_Indonesia_MO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Summing up the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/4/4040420dd82083094dc1518846ec1fb06357bae1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a+b}{c}+\\frac{b+c}{a}+\\frac{c+a}{b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"175\" height=\"39\" /> yields the result \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/a/0da5e5467a33ceb89e7cda00a2c4d9c29eca3fc5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a^2b+ab^2+b^2c+bc^2+c^2a+ca^2}{abc}=z\\in \\mathbb{Z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"330\" height=\"41\" />. Thus,\n</p><p>\\begin{align*} \na|(a^2b+ab^2+b^2c+bc^2+c^2a+ca^2)&amp;\\implies a|b^2c+bc^2\\\\\nb|(a^2b+ab^2+b^2c+bc^2+c^2a+ca^2)&amp;\\implies b|c^2a+ca^2\\\\\nc|(a^2b+ab^2+b^2c+bc^2+c^2a+ca^2)&amp;\\implies c|a^2b+ab^2\n\\end{align*}\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, are pairwise relatively prime, this implies that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/b/bcb04971aa1521dca22b49b27b1c7c026accd676.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\gcd(a,b)=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"99\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/9/ec97e1899d3739d404b7ac1cb9ff48691f703cff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\gcd(b,c)=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"100\" height=\"20\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/9/219e2e64499bf388f490d1710c9cbb2001cd3106.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\gcd(a,c)=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"102\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/3/5d3f61e584caf309d009f4380d01a7dba68c43d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a|b^2c+bc^2\\implies a|bc(b+c)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"217\" height=\"21\" />, but because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/b/bcb04971aa1521dca22b49b27b1c7c026accd676.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\gcd(a,b)=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"99\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/9/219e2e64499bf388f490d1710c9cbb2001cd3106.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\gcd(a,c)=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"102\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/f/1cf95ce729c266b9850139e6b65a55fdc1d66505.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a|b+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"54\" height=\"20\" />. Similarly, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/e/d4e9606411208bcac14a5a32650b9696f300d437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b|c+a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"54\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/d/39d71890648775aa51d0dd044049c0232e5a1632.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c|a+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"54\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>\\begin{align*} \na&amp;|b+c\\\\\nb&amp;|c+a\\\\\nc&amp;|a+b\n\\end{align*}\n</p><p>WLOG, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/7/e57c4f96dc49aa339e443ef0b7d16f9ce178cf84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\le b\\le c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"74\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>Suppose <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/8/eb8726d98aced2f3140dd77a2d8614c2e7674700.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p>Since they are pairwise relatively prime, and all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />,<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />,<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/2/2c24e4f8b8d4c523fd3bf262b8b50766c19777b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c &gt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is not equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> nor <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> is not equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />. A strict order of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/2/45215533de7e69fa3ef41bd468a3b15c02dce068.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1&lt;a&lt;b&lt;c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"109\" height=\"15\" /> can be made. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/d/39d71890648775aa51d0dd044049c0232e5a1632.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c|a+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"54\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/d/81de167a4a3db4723c6a277cc4a7a7659842962d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b&gt;a&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"77\" height=\"15\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/c/18caf1d1cda53c0d1c9c823cc92dd05b2c1fcffc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b\\ge c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"74\" height=\"17\" />. We also know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/1/f71e4ad58bf15abf2968d49c3a2267d6df9d5681.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a&lt;c$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/a/20afa9d430964d658067093a97b8f0e4a6865cb8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b&lt;c$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />, which implies that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/7/fa7212d0f038941025e1e0bbdb7a6e64d2c70696.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b&lt;2c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"83\" height=\"16\" />. Thus, the only way <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/d/39d71890648775aa51d0dd044049c0232e5a1632.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c|a+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"54\" height=\"20\" />, while <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/1/f312a357a8f7df4f4da77383c99fd0f8c4fa37e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c\\le a+b &lt; 2c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"115\" height=\"17\" />, is if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/2/98283885d75b4f7122fbdf097b56f70b147083f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b = c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"74\" height=\"16\" />. \n</p><p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/9/25908135a9770375db83c59de1187d74018e0ad8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = a+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"74\" height=\"16\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/f/03f8881031950cc6dc5dfad8d4e99c9ebab48982.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a|(a+2b)\\implies a|2b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"160\" height=\"20\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/d/78d1c963233bf697325f166bca6ec79dac6f073a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b|2a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"33\" height=\"20\" />. Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/0/710e3e4f18d7c0270ab719a00adc61fa12363b1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a&lt;b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />, we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/8/2e8e263d82741e1645531e33aa07de3290d16ee9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a&lt;2b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"62\" height=\"15\" />. Thus, in order for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/d/78d1c963233bf697325f166bca6ec79dac6f073a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b|2a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"33\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/d/1ed599673eaddf8b12222613a7773eea22233098.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b\\le 2a &lt;2b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"94\" height=\"17\" />, the only possible way is for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/8/a0874c15e47cf556c14c7f59e27992d91c3aacec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=2a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"53\" height=\"14\" />. However, we have previously established that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/8/eb8726d98aced2f3140dd77a2d8614c2e7674700.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />, and combined with the fact that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/f/8dfd7dee1d05b67cefc9c10edb827a63a0097b16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=2a \\implies \\gcd(a, b) = a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"203\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> are not co-prime, which is a contradiction.\n</p><p>Hence, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/2/502e059d1a020b368aee3a99c5669d88331d321f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nCase 1: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/5/cf590e9abb33aa9776ddc386b1ba6ee7b43fa413.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/5/cf590e9abb33aa9776ddc386b1ba6ee7b43fa413.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />. since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/d/39d71890648775aa51d0dd044049c0232e5a1632.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c|a+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"54\" height=\"20\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/d/09d90b62cbaa84609f70ec2b92b1b3f201a0d714.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c|2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"24\" height=\"20\" />. The only options will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/4/0e4cc644ec8a1c3623c13ed3d14904096a0d87b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/7/4f72da4187cb0ff8d0471bef17474df62fe69c94.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />. This gives us the answers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/d/35d43e6e252922c8df825114d48e1418c7516d6d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1,1,1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"56\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/1/331794d7011f976b755400372594feded29a75aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1,1,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"56\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><br />\nCase 2: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/9/40920163c12ad9f3ce69942d9b625b88ac82923f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/9/40920163c12ad9f3ce69942d9b625b88ac82923f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/d/ebda5306c70a24c574ef0107ed5b5152b5f594cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=c$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/1/be13b15568f19c64847552dd72da673959e624f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\gcd(b,c)=b&gt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"132\" height=\"20\" />, and they won't be co-prime. As a result, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> is strictly less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/e/d4e9606411208bcac14a5a32650b9696f300d437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b|c+a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"54\" height=\"20\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/2/502e059d1a020b368aee3a99c5669d88331d321f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/4/e84c5830e5df489d01bdb9df796fc63e648c6af5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b|c+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"54\" height=\"20\" />. Similarly, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a7253c05793047b3646c009808eff51f10f234.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c|b+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"54\" height=\"20\" />. But <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/a/20afa9d430964d658067093a97b8f0e4a6865cb8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b&lt;c$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/d/11d772c43563eca7ed0a5efabe1464e1b360bcd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=b+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"73\" height=\"16\" />. Using the fact that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/4/e84c5830e5df489d01bdb9df796fc63e648c6af5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b|c+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"54\" height=\"20\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/a/37aa3c7a1566dcfe12057be177f02ae06bdcf2c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b|b+2\\implies b|2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"125\" height=\"20\" />. Hence, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/6/7d65baaf9671227780dd04ab952911036aa5c868.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/7/8271d4342b38d2ab38bb626ffad8b9dae00b5e2d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=3$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p>Plugging in the answers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/d/35d43e6e252922c8df825114d48e1418c7516d6d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1,1,1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"56\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/f/dcfc6112a596558ea2b5c4d3009f082ec9763d21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1,2,3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"56\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/1/331794d7011f976b755400372594feded29a75aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1,1,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"56\" height=\"18\" /> all yield valid results of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/9/a295acb9662ee1bae4bb3aa92a1f42b2cfd83f10.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/e/77eb455e13266e46765af4d7b5506c4e3a6b314d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=8$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/f/a9f2444faa6428da1ca9e40d6d0ecadb6498143f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, respectively.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017215600\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.027 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.036 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 233/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 13591/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:28989:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017215600 and revision id 227404. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}